   coolers: board B J_FAN1..3: JST-SH 1.0 4 pins (1 +5V_Sn, 2 GND, 3 FAN_TACHOn, 4 FAN_PWMn) to the module's Fan_Tacho (1.8k pull-up to CM5_3.3V) and Fan_PWM (open drain); 0.1 A declared on the slot's 5.1 V rail; the header code C160390
