   REQ-043's acceptance (pcb_requirements.yaml): Each of the five fans is one its maker rates IP68 in the maker's own datasheet, filed under v2/vendor/fans/ with the pick, with a published operating range covering -20 C to the inside-air bar part_temps.py computes from pcb_envelope.yaml; the part is D-18's (a 40 mm IP68 fan that fits the coolers); a fan without that rating is a change of this statement, recorded as such; fans run in the functional check (SC-45).
   the inside air the fans must cover: REQ-043's -20 C floor; the board air at the margin 62.1 C (L4-E12); the hold's trigger 68.65 C of mixed air

